@apelisse any updates on this bug?

Our controller implementation is trying to workaround this (current approach is to check generation and observedGeneration to prevent the infinite reconcile loop), but it has a bunch of side effects and it becoming harder to maintain.

So this fix will simplify our controller code by a lot. Please let us know when you have any updates.

